msgstr "Notificaciones"

#: includes/account-sections.php:65
msgid "There is nothing to turn on or off: no notification is registered."
msgstr "No hay nada que activar o desactivar: no hay ningún aviso registrado."

#: includes/account-sections.php:72
msgid "Your data"
msgstr "Tus datos"

#: includes/account-sections.php:76
msgid ""
"Neither downloading your data nor deleting your account is allowed, so there"
" is nothing to do here."
msgstr ""
"Ni descargar los datos ni borrar la cuenta están permitidos, así que no hay "
"nada que hacer aquí."

#: includes/account-sections.php:129 includes/admin-login.php:242
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Abrir"

