msgstr "Tuya"

#: includes/admin-account.php:165
msgid "Sections"
msgstr "Secciones"

#: includes/admin-account.php:166
msgid "Where it lives"
msgstr "Dónde vive"

#: includes/admin-account.php:174 includes/admin.php:70
msgid "Account area"
msgstr "Área de cuenta"

#: includes/admin-account.php:286
msgid "New order saved."
msgstr "Listo, ese es el orden nuevo."

#: includes/admin-account.php:287
msgid "Section saved."
msgstr "Sección guardada."

#: includes/admin-account.php:288
msgid "Section removed."
msgstr "Sección eliminada."

#: includes/admin-account.php:289
msgid "That section needs a name, and an address that is not taken."
msgstr "Esa sección necesita un nombre, y una dirección que no esté ocupada."

#: includes/admin-account.php:315
msgid "There is no account page yet"
msgstr "Todavía no hay página de cuenta"

#: includes/admin-account.php:316
msgid ""
"Pick the page that has the [diluxone_users_account] shortcode, under “Where "
"it lives”. Until then the links below go nowhere."
msgstr ""
"Elige la página que tiene el shortcode [diluxone_users_account], en \"Dónde "
"vive\". Hasta entonces los enlaces de aquí abajo no llevan a ninguna parte."

#: includes/admin-account.php:322
msgid "The sections of “my account”"
msgstr "Las secciones de \"mi cuenta\""

#: includes/admin-account.php:323 includes/admin-account.php:564
msgid "Add section"
msgstr "Agregar sección"

#: includes/admin-account.php:348
msgid "Save the order"
msgstr "Guardar el orden"

#: includes/admin-account.php:409
msgid "New section"
msgstr "Sección nueva"

#: includes/admin-account.php:430
msgid "Showing"
msgstr "Se muestra"

#: includes/admin-account.php:430 includes/admin-fields.php:364
msgid "Hidden"
msgstr "Oculto"

#: includes/admin-account.php:451
msgid "Delete this section?"
msgstr "¿Borrar esta sección?"

#: includes/admin-account.php:452
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Quitar"

#: includes/admin-account.php:460
msgid "It is on, but it is not showing"
msgstr "Está activada, pero no se está mostrando"

#: includes/admin-account.php:467 includes/admin-fields.php:286
#: includes/admin-fields.php:440
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: includes/admin-account.php:470
msgid "What people read in the menu, and the title of the section."
msgstr "Lo que se lee en el menú, y el título de la sección."

#: includes/admin-account.php:474
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Dirección"

#: includes/admin-account.php:476
msgid "made from the name"
msgstr "sale del nombre"

#: includes/admin-account.php:485
msgid "Who sees it"
msgstr "Quién la ve"

#: includes/admin-account.php:494
msgid ""
"Tick nothing and everybody with an account sees it. Tick roles and only "
"those do."
msgstr ""
"Sin marcar nada la ve cualquiera que tenga cuenta. Marcando roles, solo "
"esos."

#: includes/admin-account.php:500
msgid "Where your content goes"
msgstr "Dónde va lo tuyo"

#: includes/admin-account.php:505
msgid "After what the plugin shows"
msgstr "Después de lo que muestra el plugin"

#: includes/admin-account.php:506
msgid "Before what the plugin shows"
msgstr "Antes de lo que muestra el plugin"

#: includes/admin-account.php:507
msgid "Instead of it — your content replaces the section"
msgstr "En lugar de eso — lo tuyo reemplaza la sección"

#: includes/admin-account.php:520
msgid ""
"This section is drawn by code. What you write below is added to it — unless "
"you say it replaces it."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección la pinta el código. Lo que escribas abajo se le suma, salvo que"
" digas que lo reemplaza."

#: includes/admin-account.php:528
msgid "Your content"
msgstr "Lo tuyo"

#: includes/admin-account.php:544
msgid ""
"Text, HTML, or the shortcode of another plugin. Leave it empty and the "
"section stays as the plugin draws it."
msgstr ""
"Texto, HTML, o el shortcode de otro plugin. Si lo dejas vacío, la sección "
"queda como la dibuja el plugin."

#: includes/admin-account.php:545
msgid ""
"Text, HTML, or the shortcode of another plugin — a course plugin, a "
"membership, a support desk. This is the whole section."
msgstr ""
"Texto, HTML, o el shortcode de otro plugin: uno de cursos, uno de "
"membresías, uno de soporte. Esto es toda la sección."

#: includes/admin-account.php:553
msgid "Comes from"
msgstr "Viene de"

#: includes/admin-account.php:557
msgid ""
"It comes from code, so it cannot be deleted —the code that draws it is still"
" there and it would come back— but it can be hidden."
msgstr ""
"Viene del código, así que no se puede borrar —el código que la pinta sigue "
"estando y volvería— pero sí esconder."

#: includes/admin-account.php:564
msgid "Save section"
msgstr "Guardar la sección"

#: includes/admin-account.php:571
msgid "Which page is “my account”, and how people move between its sections."
msgstr ""
"Cuál es la página de \"mi cuenta\", y cómo se mueve la gente entre sus "
"secciones."

#: includes/admin-account.php:577
msgid "The account page"
msgstr "La página de la cuenta"

#: includes/admin-account.php:591
msgid "— none —"
msgstr "— ninguna —"

#. translators: %s: the shortcode, literal
#: includes/admin-account.php:602
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The page with %s in it. Declaring it here is what lets everything else —a "
"certificate, a course, a forum— send people to the right place."
msgstr ""
"La página que tiene %s dentro. Declararla aquí es lo que hace que todo lo "
"demás —un certificado, un curso, un foro— lleve a la gente al lugar "
"correcto."

#: includes/admin-account.php:608
msgid ""
"With plain permalinks the sections go as ?seccion=…; turn on pretty "
"permalinks in Settings → Permalinks and they become /page/section/ on their "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Con enlaces permanentes simples las secciones van como ?seccion=…; activa "
"los enlaces bonitos en Ajustes → Enlaces permanentes y pasan a ser "
"/pagina/seccion/ solas."

#: includes/admin-account.php:613
msgid "The menu"
msgstr "El menú"

#: includes/admin-account.php:619
msgid "Tabs across the top"
msgstr "Pestañas arriba"

#: includes/admin-account.php:620
msgid "A menu down the side"
msgstr "Un menú al costado"

#: includes/admin-account.php:621
msgid "No menu — the site places it with [diluxone_users_account_nav]"
msgstr "Sin menú — lo pone el sitio con [diluxone_users_account_nav]"

#: includes/admin-account.php:634
msgid "The header"
msgstr "La cabecera"

#: includes/admin-account.php:638
msgid "Show the name and the initials at the top"
msgstr "Mostrar el nombre y las iniciales arriba"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:182
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "Estilos"

#: includes/admin-account.php:168
msgid "Profile photo"
msgstr "Foto de perfil"

#: includes/admin-account.php:188 templates/account/notifications.php:16
#: templates/fields.php:30
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Listo, guardado."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:186
msgid "Load the plugin stylesheet"
msgstr "Cargar la hoja de estilos del plugin"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:188
msgid ""
"Only turn it off if the site is going to style every diluxone-users-* class "
"itself. Turned off, its panels and buttons come out bare and the site has to"
" draw them; re-pointing the properties is almost always enough, and it "
"survives the plugin adding a new component."
msgstr ""
"Desactívala solo si el sitio va a dar estilo a cada clase diluxone-users-* "
"por su cuenta. Desactivada, sus paneles y botones salen desnudos y los tiene"
" que dibujar el sitio; reapuntar las propiedades basta casi siempre, y "
"sobrevive a que el plugin añada un componente nuevo."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:193
msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Modo oscuro"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:195
msgid ""
"There is none here, on purpose. Dark mode belongs to the site: a light site "
"seen from a dark system used to end up with a light page and black panels. "
"If the site has a dark mode, its own tokens change and these follow."
msgstr ""
"Aquí no hay, a propósito. El modo oscuro es del sitio: un sitio claro visto "
"desde un sistema en oscuro terminaba con la página clara y los paneles en "
"negro. Si el sitio tiene modo oscuro, cambian sus tokens y esto va con "
"ellos."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:199
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "Color de acento"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:202
msgid "Buttons, the open tab, links and the drawn avatars."
msgstr ""
"Los botones, la pestaña abierta, los enlaces y los avatares dibujados."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:206
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Esquinas"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:209
msgid "pixels — empty for the default"
msgstr "píxeles — vacío para el valor por defecto"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:213
msgid "Templates"
msgstr "Plantillas"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:215
msgid ""
"Copy any file from the plugin’s templates/ folder to your theme and edit it "
"there:"
msgstr ""
"Copia cualquier archivo de la carpeta templates/ del plugin a tu tema y "
"edítalo ahí:"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:227
msgid ""
"Three layers, in this order: the photo the person uploaded, then Gravatar, "
"then their initials drawn on the accent colour. Turn off the ones you do not"
" want."
msgstr ""
"Tres capas, en este orden: la foto que subió la persona, después Gravatar, "
"después sus iniciales dibujadas sobre el color de acento. Desactiva las que "
"no quieras."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:231
msgid "Where it comes from"
msgstr "De dónde sale"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:235
msgid "Let people upload their own"
msgstr "Dejar que cada uno suba la suya"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:239
msgid "Fall back to Gravatar when there is none"
msgstr "Si no hay ninguna, ir a buscarla a Gravatar"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:243
msgid "Otherwise, draw their initials"
msgstr "Y si tampoco, dibujar sus iniciales"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:245
msgid ""
"Gravatar means sending a hash of every visitor’s email address to a third "
"party. With it off and initials on, nothing leaves the site."
msgstr ""
"Gravatar significa enviar a un tercero un hash del correo de cada visitante."
" Con esto desactivado y las iniciales activadas, no sale nada del sitio."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:249
msgid "Largest photo accepted"
msgstr "Foto más grande que se acepta"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:219
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Campos"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:220
msgid "How to use them"
msgstr "Cómo se usan"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:224 includes/admin-fields.php:418
#: includes/admin.php:69
msgid "User fields"
msgstr "Campos de usuario"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:227
msgid "Field saved."
msgstr "Campo guardado."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:228
msgid "Field deleted. The data already stored was left alone."
msgstr "Campo eliminado. Los datos ya cargados quedaron intactos."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:229
msgid "A field needs a name."
msgstr "El campo necesita un nombre."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:252
msgid "Where all this lives"
msgstr "Dónde vive todo esto"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:273
msgid ""
"That is why the key cannot change once the field exists, and why deleting a "
"field leaves the answers alone: they are two different things."
msgstr ""
"Por eso la clave no se puede cambiar una vez que el campo existe, y por eso "
"borrar un campo no toca las respuestas: son dos cosas distintas."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:279 includes/admin-fields.php:578
msgid "Add field"
msgstr "Agregar campo"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:287 includes/admin-fields.php:451
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tipo"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:288
msgid "Where"
msgstr "Dónde va"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:289 includes/admin-fields.php:572
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Obligatorio"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:291 includes/admin-sessions.php:156
#: includes/admin-social.php:408 includes/admin-status.php:359
#: includes/admin.php:74 templates/account/privacy.php:29
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:292
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Orden"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:297
msgid "No fields yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay campos."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:337
msgid "Delete this field? The data already stored is kept."
msgstr "¿Eliminar este campo? Los datos ya cargados se conservan."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:338
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Eliminar"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:346
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Sí"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:350
msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Sólo lectura"

#. translators: %d: how many times it can be changed
#: includes/admin-fields.php:354
#, php-format
msgid "%d time"
msgid_plural "%d times"
msgstr[0] "%d vez"
msgstr[1] "%d veces"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:364 includes/admin-sessions.php:181
#: includes/admin-social.php:161
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Activa"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:383
msgid "Move up"
msgstr "Subir"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:399
msgid "Move down"
msgstr "Bajar"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:419
msgid "That field does not exist."
msgstr "Ese campo no existe."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:428
msgid "New field"
msgstr "Campo nuevo"

#. translators: %s: field name
#: includes/admin-fields.php:429
#, php-format
msgid "Field: %s"
msgstr "Campo: %s"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:432
msgid "Back to the list"
msgstr "Volver al listado"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:444
msgid "Key:"
msgstr "Clave:"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:444
msgid "it cannot change: it is the name the data is stored under."
msgstr "no se puede cambiar: es el nombre con el que quedó guardado el dato."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:446
msgid "The key is generated from the name."
msgstr "La clave se genera sola a partir del nombre."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:467
msgid ""
"This one is WordPress’s own: it can be renamed, reordered, made required or "
"hidden, but it keeps its type and cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Éste es propio de WordPress: se puede renombrar, reordenar, hacer "
"obligatorio o esconder, pero conserva su tipo y no se puede borrar."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:469
msgid ""
"“Country” shows the full list with its dial codes; “Phone with country code”"
" splits the number in two and stores it in international format."
msgstr ""
"\"País\" muestra la lista completa con sus prefijos; \"Teléfono con prefijo "
"de país\" parte el número en dos y lo guarda en formato internacional."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:474
msgid "Who can change it"
msgstr "Quién lo puede cambiar"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:478
msgid "Whenever they want"
msgstr "Cuando quiera"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:479
msgid "Only a few times, and then no more"
msgstr "Sólo unas cuantas veces, y después no"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:480
msgid "Never — they can see it, only an administrator changes it"
msgstr "Nunca: lo ve, pero lo cambia quien administra"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:492
msgid "How many times"
msgstr "Cuántas veces"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:496
msgid ""
"This is about the person who owns the data. An administrator can always "
"change it, from the user’s profile: otherwise a one-change field turns into "
"a typo nobody can fix."
msgstr ""
"Esto es sobre la persona dueña del dato. Quien administra puede cambiarlo "
"siempre, desde el perfil de esa persona: si no, un campo de un solo cambio "
"se convierte en un error de tipeo que ya nadie arregla."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:500
msgid "Where it goes"
msgstr "Dónde va"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:507
msgid ""
"The profile form shows two blocks: the essentials first, and underneath the "
"optional ones with their own explanation. This decides which one the field "
"lands in."
msgstr ""
"El formulario del perfil muestra dos bloques: primero lo indispensable y "
"abajo lo opcional, con su propia explicación. Esto decide en cuál cae el "
"campo."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:511
msgid "Help text"
msgstr "Texto de ayuda"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:514
msgid "Why we are asking. Shown under the field."
msgstr "Por qué se lo pedimos. Se muestra debajo del campo."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:518
msgid "Placeholder text"
msgstr "Texto de ejemplo"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:521
msgid "Shown in grey inside the empty field."
msgstr "Se ve en gris dentro del campo vacío."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:525
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Valores"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:528
msgid ""
"One per line. In a fixed list they are the only accepted values; in text "
"with suggestions they are just hints and the person can write something "
"else."
msgstr ""
"Uno por línea. En una lista cerrada son los únicos valores aceptados; en el "
"texto con sugerencias son sólo pistas y la persona puede escribir otra cosa."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:533
msgid "Countries shown first"
msgstr "Países que van primero"

#. translators: %d: number of countries
#: includes/admin-fields.php:546
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Optional. The list of %d countries comes with the plugin — there is nothing "
"to load. These ones go on top, separated from the rest, so nobody has to "
"scroll to find the one next door."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. La lista de %d países la trae el plugin — no hay nada que cargar. "
"Éstos van arriba, separados del resto, para que nadie tenga que buscar el de"
" al lado."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:555
msgid "Country selected by default"
msgstr "País elegido por defecto"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:558
msgid "— None —"
msgstr "— Ninguno —"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:565
msgid ""
"The dial code the field comes with. The person can change it: the full list "
"is always there."
msgstr ""
"El prefijo con el que viene el campo. La persona lo puede cambiar: la lista "
"completa está siempre."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:570
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "Comportamiento"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:573
msgid "Active: show it in the forms"
msgstr "Activo: mostrarlo en los formularios"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:578
msgid "Save field"
msgstr "Guardar campo"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:586
msgid ""
"The fields show up on their own in the dashboard profile, when adding a user"
" and in the WordPress registration form. On the front end you place them "
"with a shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Los campos aparecen solos en el perfil del escritorio, en el alta de un "
"usuario y en el registro de WordPress. En la parte pública los pones con un "
"shortcode."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:590
msgid "Every field, for the person to edit."
msgstr "Todos los campos, para que la persona los edite."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:591
msgid "Only the basic ones. With group=\"optional\", only the others."
msgstr "Sólo los básicos. Con group=\"optional\", sólo los otros."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:592 includes/admin-social.php:425
msgid "The email sign-in form and the social buttons."
msgstr "El formulario de entrada por correo y los botones de redes."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:594 includes/admin-social.php:426
msgid "Linked providers, to link or unlink."
msgstr "Las redes vinculadas, para vincular o desvincular."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:595
msgid "Open sessions, with the button to close them."
msgstr "Las sesiones abiertas, con el botón de cerrarlas."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:599
msgid "Fitting them into your design"
msgstr "Cómo encajan en tu diseño"

#: includes/admin-home.php:191
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Falta"

#: includes/admin-home.php:192
msgid "Cannot tell"
msgstr "A confirmar"

#: includes/admin-home.php:233
msgid "Who is in this site, what is asked of them and how they get in."
msgstr "Quién está en este sitio, qué se le pide y cómo entra."

#: includes/admin-home.php:240
msgid "accounts"
msgstr "cuentas"

#: includes/admin-home.php:242
msgid "All users"
msgstr "Todos los usuarios"

#: includes/admin-home.php:247
msgid "with an open session"
msgstr "con la sesión abierta"

#: includes/admin-home.php:249
msgid "See who"
msgstr "Ver quiénes"

#: includes/admin-home.php:254
msgid "fields in use"
msgstr "campos en uso"

#: includes/admin-home.php:256
msgid "Manage them"
msgstr "Administrarlos"

#: includes/admin-home.php:261
msgid "social providers on"
msgstr "redes sociales activas"

#: includes/admin-home.php:263
msgid "Set them up"
msgstr "Configurarlas"

#: includes/admin-home.php:276 includes/admin-home.php:305
#: includes/admin-login.php:300
msgid "How people get in"
msgstr "Cómo entra la gente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:281 includes/admin-login.php:282
#: includes/admin-status.php:118
msgid "Sign-in page"
msgstr "Página de acceso"

#: includes/admin-home.php:285
msgid "Not chosen yet: wp-login.php is doing the job."
msgstr "Todavía sin elegir: lo está haciendo wp-login.php."

#: includes/admin-home.php:287
msgid "Choose it"
msgstr "Elegirla"

#: includes/admin-home.php:291
msgid "Link by email"
msgstr "Vinculación por correo"

#: includes/admin-home.php:294
msgid ""
"On. If the email does not exist, the account is created in the same step."
msgstr "Activado. Si el correo no existe, la cuenta se crea en el mismo paso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:295
msgid ""
"On, for accounts that already exist. New ones are not created from here."
msgstr "Activado, para cuentas que ya existen. Nuevas no se crean desde aquí."

#: includes/admin-home.php:299
msgid "Only the email link: wp-login.php sends people to the sign-in page."
msgstr ""
"Sólo el enlace por correo: wp-login.php manda a la gente a la pantalla de "
"ingreso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:300
msgid "Only username and password, the WordPress one."
msgstr "Sólo usuario y contraseña, el de WordPress."

#: includes/admin-home.php:301
msgid "The email link and the password, both."
msgstr "El enlace por correo y la contraseña, las dos."

#: includes/admin-home.php:311
msgid "Off: nobody is asked for a second step."
msgstr "Desactivado: no se le pide un segundo paso a nadie."

#: includes/admin-home.php:312
msgid "Optional: whoever wants it turns it on from their profile."
msgstr "Opcional: lo activa desde su perfil quien quiera."

#: includes/admin-home.php:313
msgid "Required for everybody who can use it."
msgstr "Obligatoria para todo el que pueda usarla."

#: includes/admin-home.php:317 includes/admin-login.php:17
#: includes/admin-people.php:157 templates/account/security.php:178
msgid "Two-step verification"
msgstr "Verificación en dos pasos"

#: includes/admin-home.php:323 includes/admin-login.php:18
#: includes/admin-people.php:171 templates/account/security.php:73
msgid "Passkeys"
msgstr "Passkeys"

#. translators: %s: the domain they end up tied to
#: includes/admin-home.php:328
#, php-format
msgid "On, tied to %s."
msgstr "Activadas, atadas a %s."

#: includes/admin-home.php:331
msgid "Off. It is the only way in that cannot be phished."
msgstr "Desactivadas. Es la única forma de entrar que no se puede phishear."

#: includes/admin-home.php:335 includes/admin-social.php:83
#: includes/admin-status.php:280 includes/admin-status.php:291
#: includes/admin.php:72
msgid "Social login"
msgstr "Login social"

#. translators: %s: list of providers
#: includes/admin-home.php:339
#, php-format
msgid "Working: %s"
msgstr "Funcionando: %s"

#: includes/admin-home.php:342
msgid ""
"There are providers with credentials, but none is verified and enabled yet."
msgstr ""
"Hay proveedores con credenciales, pero ninguno verificado y activado "
"todavía."

#: includes/admin-home.php:343
msgid "No provider set up yet: only the email link works."
msgstr "Ninguna red configurada: sólo funciona el enlace por correo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:346 includes/admin-social.php:45
msgid "Providers"
msgstr "Proveedores"

#: includes/admin-home.php:355
msgid "Outgoing email"
msgstr "Correo saliente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:358
msgid ""
"Something is hooked into delivery, but whether mail actually leaves cannot "
"be known from here. Send yourself a link to find out."
msgstr ""
"Hay algo enganchado al envío, pero si el correo sale de verdad no se puede "
"saber desde aquí. Envíate un enlace para averiguarlo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:359
msgid ""
"Nothing is hooked into delivery: WordPress will try the server’s mail() and "
"that usually fails. Without email there is no sign-in link."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada enganchado al envío: WordPress va a probar con el mail() del "
"servidor y eso suele fallar. Sin correo no hay enlace de acceso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:363
msgid "Session length"
msgstr "Duración de la sesión"

#. translators: 1: days with remember-me, 2: days without remember-me
#: includes/admin-home.php:367
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d days with “remember me”, %2$d without."
msgstr "%1$d días con \"recordarme\", %2$d sin."

#: includes/admin-home.php:372 includes/admin-login.php:259
msgid "Change it"
msgstr "Cambiarla"

#: includes/admin-home.php:378
msgid "What is asked of people"
msgstr "Qué se le pide a la gente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:380
msgid "Nothing beyond the email address."
msgstr "Nada más que el correo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:401
msgid "If you get locked out"
msgstr "Si te quedás afuera"

#: includes/admin-home.php:403
msgid ""
"On a site without passwords and without outgoing email, an expired session "
"leaves you outside. With access to the server:"
msgstr ""
"En un sitio sin contraseñas y sin correo saliente, una sesión vencida te "
"deja afuera. Con acceso al servidor:"

#: includes/admin-login.php:13
msgid "Registration"
msgstr "Registro"

#: includes/admin-login.php:14 includes/passwordless.php:92
#: templates/account-guest.php:15 templates/login.php:40
#: templates/login.php:102
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Entrar"

#: includes/admin-login.php:15
msgid "The email"
msgstr "El correo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:16 includes/admin-people.php:125
#: templates/account/handle-field.php:17
msgid "Public name"
msgstr "Nombre público"

#: includes/admin-login.php:25 includes/admin-sessions.php:35
#: includes/admin-social.php:64
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: includes/admin-login.php:28 includes/admin-social.php:347
#: includes/admin.php:71
msgid "Registration and login"
msgstr "Registro y acceso"

#: includes/admin-login.php:278
msgid ""
"The person types their email and gets a single-use link. There is no "
"password to choose, to remember or to steal. Put the [diluxone_users_login] "
"shortcode on the page you pick below."
msgstr ""
"La persona escribe su correo y recibe un enlace de un solo uso. No hay "
"contraseña que elegir, que recordar ni que robar. Pon el shortcode "
"[diluxone_users_login] en la página que elijas abajo."

#: includes/admin-login.php:289
msgid "— Use wp-login.php —"
msgstr "— Usar wp-login.php —"

#: includes/admin-login.php:296
msgid ""
"The page holding the form. Without it, passwordless mode is not applied: it "
"would leave the site with no way in."
msgstr ""
"La página donde vive el formulario. Sin esto, el modo \"sólo correo\" no se "
"aplica: dejaría el sitio sin puerta de entrada."

#: includes/admin-login.php:306
msgid "Both: the link, and username and password underneath"
msgstr "Las dos: el enlace, y usuario y contraseña abajo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:307
msgid "Only a link sent to their email — no passwords on this site"
msgstr "Sólo un enlace al correo — en este sitio no hay contraseñas"

#: includes/admin-login.php:308
msgid "Only the WordPress username and password"
msgstr "Sólo el usuario y la contraseña de WordPress"

#: includes/admin-login.php:319
msgid ""
"Only the first option closes anything: with “only a link”, wp-login.php "
"stops showing its form and the native registration is switched off, because "
"otherwise both would still be there and the choice would be a decoration."
msgstr ""
"Solo la primera opción cierra algo: con \"solo un enlace\", wp-login.php "
"deja de mostrar su formulario y se desactiva el registro nativo, porque si "
"no las dos puertas seguirían abiertas y la elección sería un adorno."

#. translators: %s: URL of the escape hatch
#: includes/admin-login.php:324
#, php-format
msgid "Even then there is an emergency way in for administrators: %s"
msgstr "Aun así queda una salida de emergencia para administradores: %s"

#: includes/admin-login.php:350
msgid "The link expires after"
msgstr "El enlace vence a los"

#: includes/admin-login.php:353
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "minutos"

#: includes/admin-login.php:357
msgid "Wait between requests"
msgstr "Espera entre pedidos"

#: includes/admin-login.php:360
msgid "seconds, for the same email address"
msgstr "segundos, para el mismo correo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:361
msgid "Stops the form being used as a machine for emailing third parties."
msgstr ""
"Evita que el formulario se use como máquina de mandar correos a terceros."

#: includes/admin-login.php:370
msgid ""
"This is what lands in the inbox. Leave it empty to use the text the plugin "
"ships with."
msgstr ""
"Esto es lo que llega a la bandeja de entrada. Vacío usa el texto que trae el"
" plugin."

#: includes/admin-login.php:374
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Asunto"

#: includes/admin-login.php:378
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Mensaje"

#. translators: 1 and 2: placeholders that get replaced
#: includes/admin-login.php:385
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s and %2$s are replaced. Empty uses the text above."
msgstr "Se reemplazan %1$s y %2$s. Vacío usa el texto de arriba."

#: includes/admin-login.php:403
msgid ""
"The email is the identity and nobody chooses it. This is the short name "
"people see, the one that goes in the address of their profile."
msgstr ""
"El correo es la identidad y no lo elige nadie. Esto es el nombre corto con "
"el que la gente aparece, el que va en la dirección de su perfil."

#: includes/admin-login.php:407
msgid "Offer it"
msgstr "Ofrecerlo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:411
msgid "Let people choose their public name"
msgstr "Dejar que la gente elija su nombre público"

#: includes/admin-login.php:413
msgid ""
"Turned off, the name comes from what they wrote as their first and last "
"name, and the profile address is made from that."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado, el nombre sale de lo que hayan escrito como nombre y apellidos,"
" y la dirección del perfil se construye con eso."

#: includes/admin-login.php:417
msgid "Length"
msgstr "Largo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:420
msgid "to"
msgstr "a"

#: includes/admin-login.php:422
msgid "characters"
msgstr "caracteres"

#: includes/admin-login.php:426
msgid "Letters"
msgstr "Letras"

#: includes/admin-login.php:430
msgid "Plain: a–z, digits, dot, dash and underscore"
msgstr "Simple: a–z, números, punto, guión y guión bajo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:431
msgid "Also accents and ñ"
msgstr "También acentos y ñ"

#: includes/admin-login.php:441
msgid ""
"Whatever is typed is turned into the same thing WordPress would put in a "
"URL, so what passes here is exactly what ends up in the address. Anything "
"that does not fit —punctuation, symbols, emoji— is dropped, and the person "
"sees what it turned into before saving."
msgstr ""
"Lo que se escriba se convierte en lo mismo que WordPress pondría en una URL,"
" así que lo que pasa aquí es exactamente lo que queda en la dirección. Todo "
"lo que no encaje —puntuación, símbolos, emoji— se cae, y la persona ve en "
"qué se convirtió antes de guardar."

#: includes/admin-login.php:445
msgid "Spaces"
msgstr "Espacios"

#: includes/admin-login.php:449
msgid "Turn them into dashes: “Ana Gómez” becomes ana-gomez"
msgstr "Cambiarlos por guiones: \"Ana Gómez\" queda ana-gomez"

#: includes/admin-login.php:450
msgid "Refuse them and say so"
msgstr "Rechazarlos y avisar"

#: includes/admin-login.php:460
msgid ""
"A web address cannot have spaces, so one of the two has to happen. The first"
" is what almost everybody expects; the second is for a site that would "
"rather nobody ends up with a name they did not type."
msgstr ""
"Una dirección web no puede tener espacios, así que una de las dos cosas "
"tiene que pasar. La primera es la que espera casi todo el mundo; la segunda "
"es para un sitio que prefiere que nadie termine con un nombre que no "
"escribió."

#: includes/admin-login.php:464
msgid "Taken names"
msgstr "Nombres ocupados"

#. translators: 1: user_nicename, 2: user_login
#: includes/admin-login.php:470
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Always checked, and against two things: the public names already in use "
"(%1$s) and the usernames that came with the accounts (%2$s). The second one "
"matters because a site that lets people sign in by public name would "
"otherwise have two people answering to the same text, and the link would go "
"to the wrong account."
msgstr ""
"Se chequea siempre, y contra dos cosas: los nombres públicos que ya están en"
" uso (%1$s) y los nombres de usuario con los que vinieron las cuentas "
"(%2$s). Lo segundo importa porque, en un sitio que deja entrar escribiendo "
"el nombre público, si no dos personas responderían al mismo texto y el "
"enlace saldría a la cuenta equivocada."

#: includes/admin-login.php:479
msgid "How often it can change"
msgstr "Cada cuánto se puede cambiar"

#: includes/admin-login.php:482
msgid "days between one change and the next"
msgstr "días entre un cambio y el siguiente"

#: includes/admin-login.php:483
msgid ""
"0 means whenever they like. A name that changes every day does not identify "
"anybody, and the old address stops working each time."
msgstr ""
"0 significa cuando quieran. Un nombre que cambia todos los días no "
"identifica a nadie, y la dirección vieja deja de funcionar cada vez."

#: includes/admin-login.php:487
msgid "Names nobody can take"
msgstr "Nombres que nadie puede tomar"

#: includes/admin-login.php:490
msgid ""
"One per line, or separated by commas. The obvious ones —admin, support, api,"
" login— are already blocked; these are yours to add."
msgstr ""
"Uno por línea, o separados por comas. Los obvios —admin, soporte, api, "
"login— ya están bloqueados; éstos son los tuyos."

#: includes/admin-login.php:505
msgid ""
"Who gets an account on this site, and what that account can do. Everything "
"else —how they get in afterwards— is on the next tab."
msgstr ""
"Quién tiene cuenta en este sitio, y qué puede hacer esa cuenta. Todo lo "
"demás —cómo entra después— está en la pestaña siguiente."

#: includes/admin-login.php:509
msgid "Create the account"
msgstr "Crear la cuenta"

#: includes/admin-login.php:513
msgid "If the email does not exist, register it in the same step"
msgstr "Si el correo no existe, darlo de alta en el mismo paso"

#: includes/admin-login.php:515
msgid ""
"With this, signing in and signing up are the same thing and no separate "
"registration form is needed."
msgstr ""
"Con esto, entrar y registrarse son la misma cosa y no hace falta un "
"formulario de registro aparte."

#: includes/admin-login.php:516
msgid ""
"Turned off, only people who already have an account can get in — and "
"somebody has to create the accounts from Users."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado, solo entra quien ya tiene cuenta, y las cuentas las tiene que "
"crear alguien desde Usuarios."

#: includes/admin-login.php:520
msgid "Role for new accounts"
msgstr "Rol de las cuentas nuevas"

#: includes/admin-login.php:525
msgid ""
"The same one for everybody, whether they come in by email or by a social "
"network: a role per provider is a quiet way of handing out privileges."
msgstr ""
"El mismo para todos, entren por correo o por una red social: un rol por "
"proveedor es una forma silenciosa de repartir privilegios."

#: includes/admin-login.php:529
msgid "The WordPress registration form"
msgstr "El formulario de registro de WordPress"

#: includes/admin-login.php:533
msgid "Whatever Settings → General says"
msgstr "Lo que diga Ajustes → Generales"

#: includes/admin-login.php:534
msgid "Open, whatever that setting says"
msgstr "Abierto, diga lo que diga ese ajuste"

#: includes/admin-login.php:535
msgid "Closed, whatever that setting says"
msgstr "Cerrado, diga lo que diga ese ajuste"

#: includes/admin-login.php:545
msgid ""
"This is wp-login.php?action=register and wp-signup.php, the ones WordPress "
"brings. They are decided here because this is where the accounts are "
"administered; leaving that in another screen is how a site ends up with a "
"registration form nobody remembers is open."
msgstr ""
"Son wp-login.php?action=register y wp-signup.php, los que trae WordPress. Se"
" deciden aquí porque aquí se administran las cuentas; dejar eso en otra "
"pantalla es como un sitio termina con un formulario de registro abierto que "
"nadie recuerda."

#: includes/admin-login.php:546
msgid ""
"With “only a link” as the way in, it stays closed no matter what: it would "
"hand out accounts with a password through a door the site closed."
msgstr ""
"Con \"sólo un enlace\" como forma de entrar, queda cerrado igual: repartiría"
" cuentas con contraseña por una puerta que el sitio cerró."

#: includes/admin-login.php:550
msgid "The WordPress profile screen"
msgstr "La pantalla de perfil de WordPress"

#: includes/admin-login.php:554
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "Dejarla como está"

#: includes/admin-login.php:555
msgid "Send them to their account on the site"
msgstr "Mandarlos a su cuenta en el sitio"

#: includes/admin-login.php:556
msgid "Close it: their details are edited on the site"
msgstr "Cerrarla: sus datos se editan en el sitio"

#: includes/admin-login.php:566
msgid ""
"A site that built its account area on the front does not want half the data "
"edited on another screen, with another look and other rules: the edit limits"
" and the required fields set up here do not apply there."
msgstr ""
"Un sitio que montó su área de cuenta en la parte pública no quiere que la "
"mitad de los datos se editen en otra pantalla, con otro aspecto y otras "
"reglas: los límites de edición y los campos obligatorios que se configuran "
"aquí no rigen allí."

#: includes/admin-login.php:582
msgid "How the account ends up"
msgstr "Cómo queda la cuenta"

#: includes/admin-login.php:584
msgid ""
"The email is the username and it never changes —WordPress does not allow it."
" There is no password at all, not even one nobody knows. The name shown "
"comes from what the person writes, and the fields they are asked for are the"
" ones on the User fields screen."
msgstr ""
"El correo es el nombre de usuario y no cambia nunca —WordPress no lo "
"permite—. No hay contraseña ninguna, ni siquiera una que nadie sepa. El "
"nombre que se muestra sale de lo que escriba la persona, y los campos que se"
" le piden son los de la pantalla de Campos de usuario."

#: includes/admin-login.php:598
msgid ""
"One more thing after the password or the link: a code that only that person "
"has. Whoever gets hold of an email still does not get in."
msgstr ""
"Una cosa más después de la contraseña o del enlace: un código que sólo tiene"
" esa persona. A quien se haga del correo de otro igual no lo deja entrar."

#: includes/admin-login.php:605 includes/auth.php:59
msgid "A code by email"
msgstr "Un código por correo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:606 includes/auth.php:68
msgid "An authenticator app"
msgstr "Una aplicación autenticadora"

#: includes/admin-login.php:614
msgid "When it is asked for"
msgstr "Cuándo se pide"

#: includes/admin-login.php:618
msgid "Optional: whoever wants it turns it on from their profile"
msgstr "Opcional: lo activa desde su perfil quien quiera"

#: includes/admin-login.php:619
msgid "Required: everybody who can use it has to"
msgstr "Obligatorio: todo el que pueda usarlo tiene que hacerlo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:620
msgid "Off: it is not offered at all"
msgstr "Desactivado: no se ofrece"

#: includes/admin-login.php:633
msgid "With what"
msgstr "Con qué"

#: includes/admin-login.php:641
msgid ""
"The app is the stronger one: the code never travels. The email is the one "
"people actually turn on, because there is nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación es la más fuerte: el código no viaja. El correo es el que la "
"gente activa de verdad, porque no hay nada que instalar."

#: includes/admin-login.php:645
msgid "To whom"
msgstr "A quién"

#: includes/admin-login.php:656
msgid "Coming in by email link"
msgstr "Cuando entra por el enlace de correo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:660
msgid "Work it out: ask, unless the second step is another email"
msgstr ""
"Que lo decida solo: pedirlo, salvo que el segundo paso sea otro correo"

#: includes/admin-login.php:661
msgid "Always ask"
msgstr "Pedirlo siempre"

#: includes/admin-login.php:662
msgid "Never ask"
msgstr "No pedirlo nunca"

#: includes/admin-login.php:672
msgid ""
"A code sent to the same inbox the person just opened to follow the link does"
" not prove anything the link did not prove already. An authenticator app "
"does. That is the whole rule, and it is why the first option exists: it asks"
" when asking is worth something."
msgstr ""
"Un código mandado al mismo buzón que la persona acaba de abrir para seguir "
"el enlace no prueba nada que el enlace no haya probado ya. Una aplicación "
"autenticadora sí. Ésa es toda la regla, y por eso existe la primera opción: "
"pide cuando pedir sirve para algo."

#: includes/admin-login.php:676
msgid "Remember the browser"
msgstr "Recordar el navegador"

#: includes/admin-login.php:679
msgid "days — 0 to ask every time"
msgstr "días — 0 para preguntar siempre"

#: includes/admin-login.php:680
msgid ""
"A signed cookie, no more: it does not let anybody in, it only saves "
"repeating the step on a browser that already passed it."
msgstr ""
"Una cookie firmada, nada más: no deja entrar a nadie, sólo evita repetir el "
"paso en un navegador que ya lo pasó."

#: includes/admin-login.php:696
msgid ""
"What each person can do with their own data from the site, without asking "
"anybody."
msgstr ""
"Qué puede hacer cada persona con sus propios datos desde el sitio, sin "
"pedirle nada a nadie."

#: includes/admin-login.php:700
msgid "Their data"
msgstr "Sus datos"

#: includes/admin-login.php:704
msgid "They can ask for a copy of everything and download it"
msgstr "Puede pedir una copia de todo y descargarla"

#: includes/admin-login.php:706
msgid ""
"It is the export WordPress already knows how to make: it asks for "
"confirmation by email and leaves the file ready."
msgstr ""
"Es la exportación que WordPress ya sabe hacer: pide confirmación por correo "
"y deja el archivo listo."

#: includes/admin-login.php:710
msgid "Their account"
msgstr "Su cuenta"

#: includes/admin-login.php:714
msgid "They can ask for their account to be deleted"
msgstr "Puede pedir que le borren la cuenta"

#: includes/admin-login.php:716
msgid ""
"Also confirmed by email, and never for an account that administers the site:"
" it would leave the site with nobody in charge."
msgstr ""
"También se confirma por correo, y nunca para una cuenta que administra el "
"sitio: lo dejaría sin nadie a cargo."

#: includes/admin-login.php:721
msgid ""
"With both off, the “Your data” section stops showing: an empty section is "
"worse than no section."
msgstr ""
"Con los dos desactivados, la sección \"Privacidad\" deja de mostrarse: una "
"sección vacía es peor que una sección que no está."

#: includes/admin-login.php:727
msgid ""
"A passkey is a private key that lives on the person’s device or keychain and"
" never leaves it. There is nothing on this side worth stealing, nothing to "
"reuse on another site, and it cannot be phished: the browser refuses to sign"
" for a domain that is not the one it was made for."
msgstr ""
"Una passkey es una clave privada que vive en el dispositivo o en el llavero "
"de la persona y que nunca sale de ahí. De este lado no hay nada que robar, "
"nada que reusar en otro sitio, y no se puede phishear: el navegador se niega"
" a firmar para un dominio que no es el que la creó."

#: includes/admin-login.php:731
msgid "Offer them"
msgstr "Ofrecerlas"

#: includes/admin-login.php:735
msgid "People can add passkeys and sign in with them"
msgstr "La gente puede sumar passkeys y entrar con ellas"

#. translators: %s: the domain the passkeys end up tied to
#: includes/admin-login.php:741
#, php-format
msgid ""
"They get tied to %s. If the site moves to another domain, the passkeys made "
"here stop working and have to be added again — there is no way around that, "
"and it is exactly what makes them unphishable."
msgstr ""
"Quedan atadas a %s. Si el sitio se muda a otro dominio, las que se hayan "
"creado aquí dejan de servir y hay que volver a añadirlas — no hay forma de "
"evitarlo, y es justamente lo que las hace imposibles de phishear."

#: includes/admin-login.php:747
msgid "This site is not on HTTPS. Browsers will refuse passkeys until it is."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio no está en HTTPS. Los navegadores van a rechazar las passkeys "
"hasta que lo esté."

#: includes/admin-login.php:752
msgid "Which ones"
msgstr "Cuáles"

#: includes/admin-login.php:756
msgid "Any: the device being used, a USB key, or another phone"
msgstr ""
"Cualquiera: el aparato que se está usando, una llave USB u otro teléfono"

#: includes/admin-login.php:757
msgid "Only the device being used"
msgstr "Sólo el aparato que se está usando"

#: includes/admin-login.php:767
msgid ""
"The first one lets somebody register from their laptop using their phone, "
"and lets a hardware key work. The second keeps everything on the machine in "
"front of them, which some organisations require and everybody else finds "
"annoying."
msgstr ""
"La primera deja que alguien se dé de alta desde el computadora usando el "
"celular, y deja funcionar una llave de hardware. La segunda mantiene todo en"
" la máquina que tiene delante, que es lo que exigen algunas organizaciones y"
" lo que al resto le resulta molesto."

#: includes/admin-login.php:771
msgid "Ask who they are"
msgstr "Preguntar quién es"

#: includes/admin-login.php:775
msgid "Require the fingerprint, the face or the PIN"
msgstr "Exigir la huella, la cara o el PIN"

#: includes/admin-login.php:777
msgid ""
"This is what makes a passkey count as two things at once: something they "
"have and something they are. With it off, whoever is holding an unlocked "
"device gets in, and the passkey is worth one factor."
msgstr ""
"Esto es lo que hace que una passkey valga por dos cosas a la vez: algo que "
"se tiene y algo que se es. Sin esto, entra quien tenga el aparato "
"desbloqueado en la mano, y la passkey vale por un factor."

