msgstr "Mostrar el botón"

#: includes/admin-social.php:421
msgid ""
"The buttons are drawn by the sign-in shortcode, together with the email "
"form. There is nothing else to place."
msgstr ""
"Los botones los dibuja el shortcode de acceso, junto con el formulario de "
"correo. No hay nada más que poner."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:433
#, php-format
msgid "A direct link to sign in with %s, if you want it somewhere else:"
msgstr "Un enlace directo para entrar con %s, si lo quieres en otro sitio:"

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:460
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To let people sign in with their %s account you have to create an app there."
" Below is the whole thing, click by click."
msgstr ""
"Para que la gente pueda entrar con su cuenta de %s hay que crear una "
"aplicación allí. Aquí está todo, clic por clic."

#: includes/admin-social.php:467
msgid "The URL they are going to ask you for"
msgstr "La URL que te van a pedir"

#: includes/admin-social.php:468
msgid ""
"Keep it at hand: one of the steps below asks for it, and it has to be pasted"
" exactly as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tenela a mano: uno de los pasos de abajo te la pide, y hay que pegarla tal "
"cual está."

#: includes/admin-social.php:470
msgid ""
"Depending on the provider it is called redirect URI, callback URL, return "
"URL or authorized redirect URL."
msgstr ""
"Según el proveedor se llama redirect URI, callback URL, return URL o URL de "
"redireccionamiento autorizada."

