#: includes/admin-social.php:559
msgid "Run the live test"
msgstr "Probarla en vivo"

#: includes/admin-social.php:560
msgid "Test it again"
msgstr "Probarla de nuevo"

#: includes/admin-social.php:580
msgid "Nothing loaded yet"
msgstr "Todavía no hay nada cargado"

#: includes/admin-social.php:581
msgid ""
"Create the app, load the redirect URL and paste the client ID and the secret"
" in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Crea la aplicación, carga la URL de retorno y pega el ID de cliente y el "
"secreto en Ajustes."

#: includes/admin-social.php:590
msgid "This needs to be tested"
msgstr "Falta probar esto"

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:595
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A window opens, %s asks you to authorise, and it comes back here. Nobody is "
"signed in and nothing is saved to your account — it only checks that the "
"round trip works. Until it does, the button cannot be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Se abre una ventana, %s te pide autorizar, y vuelve aquí. No entra nadie ni "
"se guarda nada en tu cuenta — solo comprueba que el ida y vuelta funciona. "
"Hasta que funcione, el botón no se puede activar."

#: includes/admin-social.php:608
msgid "Tested and working"
msgstr "Probada y funcionando"

#: includes/admin-social.php:611
