msgid "Password"
msgstr "Contraseña"

#: templates/account/security.php:58
msgid "The one on your WordPress account."
msgstr "La de tu cuenta de WordPress."

#: templates/account/security.php:59
msgid ""
"You do not have one. You get in with a link sent to your email, or with a "
"social account."
msgstr ""
"No tienes. Entras con un enlace que te enviamos por correo, o con una red "
"social."

#: templates/account/security.php:74
msgid ""
"The way in with no password and nothing to type: the fingerprint, the face "
"or the PIN of your own device. The key never leaves it, there is nothing on "
"our side worth stealing, and it cannot be used on a fake site pretending to "
"be this one."
msgstr ""
"La forma de entrar sin contraseña y sin escribir nada: la huella, la cara o "
"el PIN de tu propio aparato. La clave nunca sale de ahí, de nuestro lado no "
"hay nada que valga la pena robar, y no se puede usar en un sitio falso que "
"se haga pasar por éste."

#: templates/account/security.php:76
msgid ""
"When you get in with a passkey we do not ask for a second step: the passkey "
"already is two of them in one — the device you have, and the fingerprint, "
"face or PIN that unlocks it."
msgstr ""
"Cuando entras con una passkey no te pedimos un segundo paso: la passkey ya "
"son dos en uno — el dispositivo que tienes, y la huella, la cara o el PIN "
"que lo desbloquea."

